      "flavour_text": "Sovereign of Sheep, traveling through the barrenlands and enjoying lava surfing. He sees everyone as equals, and is happy to leave their 'mark' on this great land. Now, it's time to have some fun with him!",
      "race": null,
      "movement": "Ground",
      "attack_position": "Ranged",
